        `what the entry points at`                        IS EMPTY

-- F48: the members are the items as the line prints them AND the things each lists. "houses and buildings" and "houses", "buildings" are members;
-- "any estate, right or interest in or over land" and "any estate in or over land", "any right in or over land", "any interest in or over land" are members, the words
-- "in or over land" being read as qualifying each of estate, right and interest. A caller may use either form.

